{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":"Looking at this intake, I need to identify the files critical for implementing"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" a web-layer token expiry handler while respecting the constraint that the client layer cannot import from the"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" app layer.\n\n## Key Technical Challenge\n\nThe hint emphasizes an **inverted dependency pattern**: the client must throw"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" a well-shaped error, and the app layer must subscribe/listen to decide session exp"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":"iry—not the other way around. This is enforced by `verify-architecture.mjs` and must not be bypassed by"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" disabling rules.\n\n## Critical Context Requirements\n\n- **Lessons first**: What defects have"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" prior plans introduced?\n- **Architecture rules**: Why is upward importing forbidden?\n- **Error"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" flow**: Where do 401 responses become errors, and where are they caught?\n- **Sign-in exception**: Why must `"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":"POST /api/v1/sign-in` be exempt from auto-sign-out?\n- **Idempotency**: How to"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" ensure one redirect, not three, when multiple requests fail together\n- **Message"}
{"kind":"assistant_text","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","turn":1,"delta":" reuse**: Leverage `t.errors.UNAUTHENTICATED` and understand i18n parity"}
