{"kind":"scout_result","runId":"0mtdol606-194e5dd714db1698","selected":[".squad/plan-lessons.md","docs/architecture.md","scripts/verify-architecture.mjs","web/src/shared/api/client.ts","web/src/app/auth-context.tsx","web/src/pages/sign-in/SignInPage.tsx","web/src/shared/api/errors.ts","web/src/shared/hooks/useRequest.ts","web/src/shared/api/client.test.ts","web/src/shared/i18n/en.ts","web/src/shared/i18n/ar.ts","web/src/pages/sign-in/SignInPage.test.tsx","api/src/features/identity/identity.test.js",".squad/stories/identity/CRM-41/intake.md","scripts/criteria/identity.md","web/src/app/require-auth.tsx","web/src/app/desk-shell/DeskShell.tsx","api/src/features/identity/identity.rules.js"],"reasoning":"This story requires inverting the dependency between web client error handling and app-level session management—the most interesting technical constraint highlighted in the hints.\n\n**Tiers of relevance:**\n\n1. **Patterns & Constraints** (must read before coding):\n   - `plan-lessons.md`: Prior defects to avoid, especially architecture violations\n   - `architecture.md`: Layer boundaries and why shared/ cannot import from app/\n   - `verify-architecture.mjs`: The rule enforcement script that must pass\n\n2. **Core Implementation Chain** (the error flow):\n   - `client.ts`: Where 401 responses land and must be converted to ApiError\n   - `auth-context.tsx`: Where signOut() lives and where the error handler subscribes\n   - `errors.ts`: The ApiError shape that connects them\n\n3. **The Sign-in Exception** (the trap):\n   - `SignInPage.tsx`: How the sign-in request is made; must be marked to skip auto-sign-out\n   - Related: `SignInPage.test.tsx` for testing patterns\n\n4. **Request Surface & Idempotency**:\n   - `useRequest.ts`: How errors surface to screens; key for understanding where to attach the subscription\n   - `client.test.ts`: Existing patterns for testing 401 handling\n\n5. **Messages & Internationalization**:\n   - `en.ts` & `ar.ts`: Reuse `t.errors.UNAUTHENTICATED` (\"Your session has ended. Sign in again to continue.\"); verify parity\n\n6. **API & Dependency Context**:\n   - `identity.test.js`: Shows the API already refuses expired tokens with 401; basis for testing\n   - `identity.rules.js`: TOKEN_TTL_SECONDS context (8 hours)\n   - `CRM-41/intake.md`: IDENTITY-1-WEB (token issuance) is a hard dependency\n\n7. **Acceptance Criteria & Existing Wiring**:\n   - `criteria/identity.md`: Formal acceptance criteria checklist\n   - `require-auth.tsx`: Route guard that checks authentication\n   - `DeskShell.tsx`: Current location of signOut button wiring; reference point"}
